    "requirements": "actual matrix/shuffle op remains inside timed backedge; direction,width,count checked per specialization; reject unexpected timed LDS/STS replacing intended matrix operation; record checksum and barrier instructions as overhead; family B binds exact kernel symbols and timed-loop instruction counts for each matrix direction or shuffle stream configuration"
  }
